      "id": 8219,
      "name": "Pydro",
      "username": "Pydro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-16T11:12:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Let's say&nbsp;Visonary plays&nbsp;WtM on an Equipment or Ongoing that just gained hp from Imbued Vitality. If Imbued Vitality leaves play first, and the card is no longer&nbsp;a target, what happens to WtM?</p><p>Since someone might ask: You might want to drop another Ongoing knowing that X will be destroyed next round, and you want to save a different card. Or an upcoming attack will deal damage based on the number of Ongoing cards, and you have some counter-attacks ready to bounce it back, or need the damage high enough so that certain DR cards can activate.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:41.497Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 2,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 10.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 8216,
      "topic_slug": "imbued-vitality-and-wtm",
      "display_username": "Pydro",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
