      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Let&#39;s say&nbsp;Visonary plays&nbsp;WtM on an Equipment or Ongoing that just gained hp from Imbued Vitality. If Imbued Vitality leaves play first, and the card is no longer&nbsp;a target, what happens to WtM?</p><p>Since someone might ask: You might want to drop another Ongoing knowing that X will be destroyed next round, and you want to save a different card. Or an upcoming attack will deal damage based on the number of Ongoing cards, and you have some counter-attacks ready to bounce it back, or need the damage high enough so that certain DR cards can activate.</p>",
