    {
      "id": 66020,
      "name": "Nielzabub",
      "username": "Nielzabub",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-16T11:21:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wrest the Mind states that it is destroyed when the target leaves play. If imbued Vitality is destroyed, the card is no longer in play, but is still a target, so I'd rule that WTM stays in play. There's not a lot of point in playing WTM on Equipment or Ongoing cards though, since most of them don't do damage themselves. It is usually the heroes that are doing the damage, not their stuff.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:43:36.522Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
