      "created_at": "2013-06-16T11:26:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Nielzabub\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/48/1986_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nielzabub:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>There's not a lot of point in playing WTM on Equipment or Ongoing cards though, since most of them don't do damage themselves. It is usually the heroes that are doing the damage, not their stuff.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I completely agree. It is more of a theoretical question than a practical one.&nbsp;I do see some very rare cases where someone might want to, e.g. if they need another Ongoing in play and there are no other valid targets for WtM.</p>",
