      "created_at": "2013-06-16T12:03:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm just saying what makes sense to me based on what the card says, and so it is possible that there was an official ruling saying otherwise. I think the discussion though was with Chrono's bounties on targets like Baron Blade and the Enead that flip when they're incapacitated.</p>",
