    {
      "id": 66025,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-16T13:21:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Chrono-Ranger's Bounties was about if they counted as leaving play for the Ennead, The Operative, and even placing them on cards that gained HP from Imbued Vitality. The ruling was that if a card was a target and stops being a target for whatever reason the taret leaves play.</p><p>So Wrest the Mind would be destroyed once Imbued Vitality is destroyed.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
